{"reviews":[{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-0","r":5.0,"t":"Pretty & Functional!","x":"These are perfect! I have hair past my shoulders and can easily wrap it up with any of these. I was nervous as there were no reviews when I purchased but the designs are pretty and I\u2019m very happy with my purchase","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-1","r":4.0,"t":"Great purchase","x":"Inexpensive and lovely. All pairs are solid, haven't bent when used and look great. The more intricate ones with patterned shafts have a few designed projections, in theory to hold the hair better, but I find they tugh the hair a bit. I prefer the ones with smooth shafts. Loved this purchase.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-2","r":3.0,"t":"Cute, but one snapped because it was very bent when it arrived.","x":"They look beautiful, but I was extremely disappointed that one came in very bent and when I tried to gently push it back to straight, it instantly snapped. To make it worse, it was one of my favorite designs.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great set!","x":"Super fun, and so many are included that I can keep one upstairs, downstairs, in my car, in my purse, and still have some left to choose from!! They are sturdy, hold my long, curly hair up all day, and very comfortable.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-4","r":5.0,"t":"Love them!","x":"I live the weight of these hair sticks! I just need to learn how to properly use them! And they are GORGEOUS!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-5","r":4.0,"t":"Style A","x":"They\u2019re all very lovely. Well made for the price. My only complaint is that one of the sticks is severely bent. An easy fix of course, but shouldn\u2019t be necessary.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-6","r":4.0,"t":"Cute","x":"They are cute and functional.  I am giving 4 stars because I did not receive the variety in the picture.  I got 4 of the butterflies.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-7","r":3.0,"t":"Good value, except some of the pins aren't worth it.","x":"These pins are a mixed bag. The double-tined pins are the best. Those pins are long and strong, with a touch of flexibility. One of these keeps my hair up and out of the way without snagging or pulling.  The single pins, are also strong and flexible...just not very long. If you've got lots of thick curly hair as I do, it will take several strategically placed pins to keep things together.  Finally some of the single pins have a raised design that runs the full length of the too-short pin. The pr","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-8","r":4.0,"t":"Made to last","x":"I love the different designs and the weight on the pins.  They are well worth the money","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-9","r":4.0,"t":"Best with long hair","x":"My hair is a little short for these pins. But, they look nice, and work.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-10","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful!","x":"Beautiful! Quality is better than expected.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-11","r":2.0,"t":"If you like the twirled/twisted chopstick/pencil/knitting needle bun, these do NOT work for that.","x":"I can't complain too much because of the price, but they are pretty cheap in quality. It's too late to return them, and they really done work for me. (a LOT of fine hair.)  - The sticks are too short to actually do an updo/bun with, but you can put them in finished updo/bun. - The forks are longer, but very bendy. - The forks and sticks have no texture to them to prevent them from just sliding out of your hair. (Except for one set. Hairspray can help, but only so much) - To get them to hold up a","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-12","r":4.0,"t":"Cute but long","x":"I got these pretty hesitant after reading iffy reviews, but these have worked great for me! I wish that they were not as long for some of them because when I tilt my head back they get pushed up and out which loosens my hair style. That said, they are really stylish and quite sharp. Might come in handy when walking alone","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-13","r":5.0,"t":"They're good","x":"It has a little bit of weight when you hold it but it doesn't feel heavy in your hair.  They all came in good condition and I got two of each one. One is missing in the picture, cause I got excited and put one in my hair immediately after I opened the package.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-14","r":5.0,"t":"Comfortable to Wear","x":"The hair sticks are very sturdy and beautiful. They have not changed colors. They're very comfortable to wear even though my Sisterlocks are heavy. I use them to put my Sisterlocks in a French roll  I received my package on time. Customer service is great!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-15","r":5.0,"t":"I love these","x":"I love all of these. It is a great value for the price. Two of the designs have a raised pattern along the shaft, which is not really good because it can drag on your hair as you push it through, but otherwise, they are all very lovely and versatile.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-16","r":5.0,"t":"I love them!","x":"This set of hair pins is great. I\u2019ve read some reviews about some arriving broken. I didn\u2019t have any issues. In fact, the quality was better than I expected. They are prettier in person, in my opinion. Really great value.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-17","r":5.0,"t":"Great Buy!!!","x":"These are very pretty. Medium weight metal. Hold lots of hair in place. I am surprised you get 10 for this price. I have paid $5 for one in the past. If you have long hair you can't go wrong with this purchase.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-18","r":4.0,"t":"They work for thick hair!","x":"The sticks with the double are great for thick hair, the single sticks don't seem to hold as well.  Glad I purchased them, so hard to find hair accessories for thick hair, and I found them very easy to use.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-19","r":5.0,"t":"Gorgeous and sturdy","x":"Bought as a Christmas gift for my sister who has especially long hair. They're stylish and subtle in their appearance, so it's just enough to catch the eye. Made me want to buy some for myself... haha","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality!","x":"The quality of these are GREAT! They're very solid, but not over weighted so they fall out. They held my hair (very long and thick) without pulling or falling out.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-21","r":5.0,"t":"These are great","x":"For the money they are really cuter than I imagined. I cut my hair off before I received them so not sure I can actually use them but they are worth the money.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-22","r":3.0,"t":"The double prongs break :(","x":"I can only give it 3 stars because only half the package was useful. The single prong ones are perfect. All of the double prongs broke like wishbones.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-23","r":5.0,"t":"They are solidly made and beautiful. I\u2019m very pleased.","x":"I\u2019m giving these as a gift to my daughter. I\u2019m sure she\u2019ll love them. She loves to put her hair up with pins like these. They\u2019re lovely. Thank you.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07MLGCDRD-24","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect hair accessory!!","x":"Love these!! They are elegant, and keepsakes. I got so many I gave them away as gifts and everybody LOVES them!! Great price....highly recommend.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the hair sticks as beautiful, pretty, or gorgeous.","cites":[1,2,3,5,6,7,9,11,13,15]},{"text":"Many customers find them sturdy, well made, and good value for the price.","cites":[2,4,6,8,9,11,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers report receiving bent or damaged sticks, with one snapping when straightened.","cites":[3,6,12]},{"text":"Some customers note the sticks are too long or too short for their hair or preferred bun style.","cites":[8,10,12,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention not receiving the variety of designs shown in the picture.","cites":[7]}]},"qa":[]}